        <profile name="Blight Racks (Aura)" id="c549-cba5-9b73-141f" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly BUBONIC ASTARTES unit is within 6&quot; of this model, blight grenades models in that unit are equipped with have an Armour Penetration characteristic of -1 and a Damage characteristic of 2.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Foul Infusion" id="b36e-edf5-fe47-acc3" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">Once per turn, at the start of either your Charge phase or the Fight phase, you can select one friendly &lt;PLAGUE COMPANY&gt; CORE unit within 6&quot; of this model. Until the start of your next Command phase, each time a model in that unit makes a melee attack with a Plague Weapon, an unmodified wound roll of 6 inflicts 1 mortal wound on the target in addition to any normal damage. Each unit can only be selected for this ability once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
