        <profile name="Tainted Narthecium (Aura)" id="e401-cd70-ed42-79b9" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">While a friendly BUBONIC ASTARTES INFANTRY unit is within 3&quot; of this model, each time a model in that unit would lose a wound, roll one D6; on a 6, that wound is not lost.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
        <profile name="Revitalising Malignancy" id="5f2a-c20e-4793-c483" hidden="false" typeId="72c5eafc-75bf-4ed9-b425-78009f1efe82" typeName="Abilities">
          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">At the end of your Movement phase, this model can heal one friendly BUBONIC ASTARTES INFANTRY model whose unit is within 3&quot; of it. That model regains up to D3 lost wounds. Each model can only be healed once per turn.</characteristic>
          </characteristics>
        </profile>
      </profiles>
    </selectionEntry>
