                <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A Pox Furnace is an Obstacle Terrain feature with the following terrain traits, as described in the Warhammer 40,000 Core Book: Light Cover, Heavy Cover, Unstable Position, Difficult Ground. If a Miasmic Malignifier is destroyed, its Pox Furnace is also removed from the battlefield.</characteristic>
