                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">This unit is eligible to shoot in a turn in which it Fell Back, but if it does, then until the end of the turn, each time a model in this unit makes a ranged attack, subtract 1 from that attack’s hit roll.</characteristic>
