                          <characteristics>
                            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">After this unit has shot, select one enemy unit that suffered one or more hits from ranged attacks made by any models in this unit this phase. Until the end of the phase, each time a friendly DEATH GUARD model makes an attack against that enemy unit with a plague weapon, an unmodified hit roll of 6 scores 1 additional hit. A unit can only be selected for this ability once per phase.</characteristic>
